    "detailed_description": "<strong>Astronomia</strong> is a spatial 3D puzzle game with a minimalist classic arcade art style.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346630/extras/5e6aa5832bb2b9d2170509ad8d51f548.poster.avif?t=1594166464\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346630/extras/5e6aa5832bb2b9d2170509ad8d51f548.webm?t=1594166464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346630/extras/5e6aa5832bb2b9d2170509ad8d51f548.mp4?t=1594166464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Guide the ball around each level to clear every <strong>fragment block</strong> and unlock the <strong>goal</strong>.<br></li><li> Bonk, sling, and warp your way around <strong>25 levels</strong>.<br></li><li> Missteps are easily undone with the ability to <strong>undo</strong> any number of your previous moves, or simply <strong>restart</strong> the level from the beginning.</li></ul><br>A fun brain-teaser for casual and hardcore puzzlers alike!",
